          "id": "about-text-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 2,
          "props": {
            "text": "I'm Bradley Ross, a seasoned designer with a passion for creating intuitive and beautiful digital experiences. With X years of experience, I specialize in UI/UX design, front-end development, and bringing complex ideas to life through thoughtful design."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "about-text-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 3,
          "props": {
            "text": "My goal is always to blend aesthetics with functionality, ensuring every project not only looks great but also provides a seamless user journey. I thrive on problem-solving and collaborating with teams to deliver impactful solutions."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "about-image",
          "type": "image",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 4,
          "props": {
            "image": "https://via.placeholder.com/600x400/6a99ff/1a1a1a?text=Bradley+Ross",
